+---
+name: start-story
+description: >
+  Canon-aware start-story for Morris. Detects domain:data-pipeline tag,
+  loads gc-data-v2 canon (source README + platform docs), attaches to
+  the seed bundle, then chains to the framework start-story skill.
+category: workflow-orchestration
+agent: morris
